---
/**
 * LandingEcosystem.astro
 * High-taste real UI web app mockups for Designer Phase & Merchant Phase.
 */
---

<section class="py-24 px-6 border-t border-light bg-canvas" id="ecosystem" aria-labelledby="ecosystem-heading">
  <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto flex flex-col gap-16">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center opacity-0 animate-lp-fade-up">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-[clamp(1.875rem,4vw,3rem)] font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight text-main mb-4" id="ecosystem-heading">
        Dirancang Desainer.<br />
        <span class="text-primary">Dijual untuk UMKM.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[1.0625rem] text-muted max-w-[52ch] mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Siklus ekosistem kami memberdayakan kreator lokal untuk membangun etalase digital bagi ribuan pedagang Banyuwangi.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">

      <!-- Phase 1: Designer Builder Studio Mockup -->
      <article class="group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-card border border-light shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-xl opacity-0 animate-lp-fade-up [animation-delay:80ms]">
        <!-- Top Real Desktop Studio Builder Mockup Window -->
        <div class="h-[250px] bg-slate-950 p-4 border-b border-light flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden relative font-sans">
          <!-- Window Chrome Bar -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-slate-800 text-3xs">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500"></span>
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
              <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-slate-400 text-[9px]">studio.pinoka.id/editor/batik-asri</span>
            </div>
            <span class="bg-primary/20 text-primary border border-primary/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold text-[9px]">
              Studio Desainer
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Studio Builder Canvas UI Demonstration -->
          <div class="my-auto grid grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 items-center">
            <!-- Left Tool Sidebar Mockup -->
            <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-2.5 space-y-1.5 text-[8px] text-slate-300">
              <div class="font-bold text-white text-[9px] border-b border-slate-800 pb-1">Komponen Editor</div>
              <div class="bg-primary/20 text-primary border border-primary/30 p-1 rounded font-semibold truncate">❖ Header Nav</div>
              <div class="bg-slate-800 p-1 rounded truncate">❖ Hero Banner</div>
              <div class="bg-slate-800 p-1 rounded truncate">❖ Katalog Produk</div>
              <div class="bg-slate-800 p-1 rounded truncate">❖ WA Order CTA</div>
            </div>

            <!-- Main Canvas Template Preview -->
            <div class="col-span-2 bg-slate-900 border-2 border-primary rounded-xl p-3 shadow-lg space-y-2 relative">
              <div class="absolute -top-2 -right-2 bg-emerald-500 text-slate-950 text-[8px] font-black px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full shadow-xs">
                Royalti 70% Ready
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[9px]">
                <span class="font-bold text-white font-heading">Template Batik Asri</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono font-bold">Rp 150.000</span>
              </div>
              <div class="h-12 rounded-lg bg-purple-900/40 border border-purple-500/30 p-2 flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="space-y-0.5">
                  <div class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white">Kain Batik Tulis Gajah Oling</div>
                  <div class="text-[7px] text-purple-300">Layout Terbukti Konversi Tinggi</div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[8px] bg-primary text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">Terjual 45x</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Bottom Status Bar -->
          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between text-[9px] text-slate-400">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓ Siap Diterbitkan ke Marketplace</span>
            <span>Komisi Otomatis Desainer</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Text Content -->
        <div class="p-8 flex flex-col gap-3 relative z-10 flex-1">
          <span class="self-start text-3xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider py-1 px-3 rounded-full text-primary bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20">
            01 · Fase Desainer
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-main tracking-tight m-0">
            Studio Drag & Drop Kreator
          </h3>
          <p class="text-body-base text-muted leading-relaxed m-0 max-w-[42ch]">
            Visual builder memanjakan desainer lokal. Susun komponen etalase dengan presisi tanpa perlu mengerti koding, lalu raih royalti pasif dari setiap penjualan template.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Phase 2: Merchant Smartphone Storefront & WA Order Mockup -->
      <article class="group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-card border border-light shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-emerald-500/40 hover:shadow-xl opacity-0 animate-lp-fade-up [animation-delay:200ms]">
        <!-- Top Real Smartphone Mockup Container -->
        <div class="h-[250px] bg-slate-950 p-4 border-b border-light flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden relative font-sans">
          <!-- Smartphone Outer Frame -->
          <div class="w-[240px] h-[210px] bg-slate-900 border-2 border-slate-700 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-2.5 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
            <!-- Smartphone Header Bar & Notch -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[8px] text-slate-400 pb-1.5 border-b border-slate-800">
              <span class="font-bold text-white">09:41</span>
              <div class="w-10 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-800"></div>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">5G 100%</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Live Mobile Storefront Content -->
            <div class="my-auto space-y-2 py-1">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-slate-800 p-2 rounded-lg">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-primary text-white text-[8px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[10px]">storefront</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white font-heading">Warung Kopi Ijen</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[7px] bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">Buka</span>
              </div>

              <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="space-y-0.5">
                  <div class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white">Kopi Susu Aren (350ml)</div>
                  <div class="text-[8px] text-amber-300 font-bold">Rp 18.000</div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[8px] bg-primary text-white px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-bold">Pesan WA</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- WhatsApp Toast Notification Overlay Mockup -->
            <div class="bg-emerald-600 text-white p-2 rounded-xl text-[8px] space-y-0.5 shadow-lg border border-emerald-400/30">
              <div class="font-bold flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[11px]">chat</span>
                  <span>Pesanan Masuk via WA</span>
                </span>
                <span class="text-[7px] text-emerald-100">Baru Saja</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[7.5px] text-emerald-100 truncate">"2x Kopi Susu Aren (Rp 36.000) • Alamat: Banyuwangi"</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Text Content -->
        <div class="p-8 flex flex-col gap-3 relative z-10 flex-1">
          <span class="self-start text-3xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider py-1 px-3 rounded-full text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20">
            02 · Fase UMKM Merchant
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-main tracking-tight m-0">
            Toko Live. Langsung Terima Order WA.
          </h3>
          <p class="text-body-base text-muted leading-relaxed m-0 max-w-[42ch]">
            Pedagang tinggal pilih template desainer, isi foto & daftar harga produk, dan toko online langsung siap menerima pesanan terformat via WhatsApp tanpa komisi potongan.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
